    {
      "id": "settle-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 95,
      "y": 670,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "SETTLE_BILLING_CYCLE  (subscription.ts:355-427)\n────────────────────────────────────────────\n1. Guard: ACTIVE only\n2. Guard: settlementDate >= currentBillingCycleStart\n3. Overage window = min(settlementDate, nextBillingDate)\n4. For each metric across all services:\n   a. cost = calculateOverageCost(metric) → totalDebt\n   b. if shouldResetMetric(metric, billingCycle) → usage = 0\n5. If autoRenew:\n   a. Add recurring costs for next cycle → totalDebt\n   b. currentBillingCycleStart = nextBillingDate\n   c. nextBillingDate += cycleDuration\n6. If !autoRenew:\n   a. status → EXPIRING\n   b. expiringSince = settlementDate",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#862e9c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 411,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": "settle-box",
      "groupIds": ["settle"]
    },

