      "x": 635,
      "y": 670,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "calculateProratedCost(amount, start, end, effective)\n= (remainingDays / totalDays) * amount\n────────────────────────────────────────\nD-1 ADD GROUP (service-group.ts:17-84)\n  ACTIVE + recurringAmount → totalDebt += prorated\n  PENDING → no proration, just config\n\nD-2 REMOVE GROUP (service-group.ts:85-121)\n  ACTIVE + recurringCost → totalCredit += prorated\n  PENDING → just removes, no credit\n\nServices: NO proration (groups are billable unit)\n────────────────────────────────────────\nGoogle Workspace Mar 2026:\n  Same formula on quantity delta (3→1 seats)\n  GAP: no quantity field on ServiceGroup yet",
